---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import AssessmentList from "../components/AssessmentList";
---

<Base title="Smart Market Watchlist — Step 0">
  <main style="max-width: 52rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;">
    <h1>Smart Market Watchlist</h1>
    <p>
      <strong>Step 0 — the disclosure spike.</strong> One authoritative source travelling
      the whole path: exchange filing → adapter → evidence → normalization → event
      candidate → provenance → the Meaningful Change Engine → persisted assessment →
      this page.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.9em;">
      Deliberately unstyled. The market and news adapters do not exist yet, so most
      verdicts read <em>unable to evaluate reliably</em> rather than <em>no meaningful
      change</em> — the system declining to call silence a conclusion.
    </p>
    <hr />
    <AssessmentList client:load />
  </main>
</Base>
